ic speed. The accurate range of railguns is very good, but due to technical limitations it cannot use onboard guidance. This results in a fairly rapid drop in accuracy at extreme ranges. \n\n\n\nRequires hybrid ammo types: Antimatter, Iridium, Iron, Lead, Plutonium, Thorium, Tungsten, Uranium.',11140,10,200,5,0.5,1,0,20000000,'',564,0.07,0,349,34287361,106140,94612),(562,74,'Light Electron Blaster I','Particle blasters operate on a similar principle as the railgun except they fire a magnetically contained ball of subatomic particles. No other turret class can match the sheer destructive power of particle blasters, but due to the rapid dispersion of the containment field, it also has the worst range of all turrets. \n\n\n\nRequires hybrid ammo types: Antimatter, Iridium, Iron, Lead, Plutonium, Thorium, Tungsten, Uranium.',11127,10,150,5,0.5,1,0,60000000,'',561,0.07,0,376,34287454,106141,94613),(563,74,'Light Ion Blaster I','Particle blasters operate on a similar principle as the railgun except they fire a magnetically contained ball of subatomic particles. No other turret class can match the sheer destructive power of particle blasters, but due to the rapid dispersion of the containment field, it also has the worst range of all turrets. \n\n\n\nRequires hybrid ammo types: Antimatter, Iridium, Iron, Lead, Plutonium, Thorium, Tungsten, Uranium.',11128,10,175,5,0.3,1,0,90000000,'',561,0.07,0,376,34287456,106142,94614),(564,74,'Light Neutron Blaster I','Particle blasters operate on a similar principle as the railgun except they fire a magnetically contained ball of subatomic particles. No other turret class can match the sheer destructive power of particle blasters, but due to the rapid dispersion of the containment field, it also has the worst range of all turrets. \n\n\n\nRequires hybrid ammo types: Antimatter, Iridium, Iron, Lead, Plutonium, Thorium, Tungsten, Uranium.',11129,10,80,5,0.2,1,0,120000000,'',561,0.07,0,376,34287458,106143,94615),(565,74,'150mm Railgun