ss, as the nanites use themselves up along with the trace elements mixed into their carrier fluid.\n\n\n\nThe Repair Paste is generally only used for emergency on-site repairs. It is then recommended to have the damaged components looked at by a certified technician at first opportunity.',0,0,2500,0.01,0,10,0,65000000,'',0,0,0,3302,16691746,105811,94297),(3977,72,'Large Proton Smartbomb I','Radiates an omnidirectional pulse from the ship that causes explosive damage to surrounding vessels.',2034,1000,100,50,0,1,0,3000000000,'',381,0.07,0,112,16676592,71797,82858),(3978,152,'Large Proton Smartbomb I Blueprint','',0,0,0,0.01,0,1,0,30000000000,'',341,0,0,112,16682827,77006,0),(3979,72,'Large Proton Smartbomb II','Radiates an omnidirectional pulse from the ship that causes explosive damage to surrounding vessels.',2034,1000,100,50,0,1,0,4779520000,'',381,0.06,0,112,16673107,68309,80062),(3980,152,'Large Proton Smartbomb II Blueprint','',0,0,0,0.01,0,1,0,99999990000,'',341,0,0,112,16682828,77007,0),(3981,72,'Large Graviton Smartbomb I','Radiates an omnidirectional pulse from the ship that causes kinetic damage to surrounding vessels.',2033,1000,100,50,0,1,0,3200000000,'',381,0.07,0,112,16673108,68310,80063),(3982,152,'Large Graviton Smartbomb I Blueprint','',0,0,0,0.01,0,1,0,32000000000,'',341,0,0,112,16682829,77008,0),(3983,72,'Large Graviton Smartbomb II','Radiates an omnidirectional pulse from the ship that causes kinetic damage to surrounding vessels.',2033,1000,100,50,0,1,0,4843520000,'',381,0.06,0,112,16673109,68311,80064),(3984,152,'Large Graviton Smartbomb II Blueprint','',0,0,0,0.01,0,1,0,99999990000,'',341,0,0,112,16682830,77009,0),(3985,912,'Nano Paint Blueprint','',0,0,0,0.01,0,1,0,500000000000,'',0,0,0,0,16691747,105812,0),(3986,585,'Large Remote Hull Repair System II','This module uses nano-assemblers to repair damage done to the hull of the Target ship.',0,0,20,50,0,1,0,2461860000,'',1062,0.07,0,80,22286523,261680,261681),(3987,72,'Large Plasma 