gates and is considered a good scout and cargo-runner.  Uncharacteristically for a Minmatar ship, its hard outer coating makes it difficult to destroy, while the limited weapon hardpoints force it to rely on fighter assistance if engaged in combat.\n\n\n\nThe markings on this ship reveal no obvious connection to the Republic.',45,61,2250000,22500,75,1,2,0,'\0',0,0,0,0,16677098,72307,83283),(29879,683,'Independent Green-Crewed Rifter','The Rifter is a very powerful combat frigate and can easily \n\ntackle the best frigates out there. It has gone through \n\nmany radical design phases since its inauguration during \n\nthe Minmatar Rebellion. The Rifter has a wide variety of \n\noffensive capabilities, making it an unpredictable and deadly adversary. \n\n\n\nThe markings on this ship reveal no obvious connection to the Republic.',46,61,2250000,22500,75,1,2,0,'\0',0,0,0,0,16677099,72308,83284),(29881,683,'Independent Green-Crewed Vigil','The Vigil is an unusual Minmatar ship, serving both as a long range scout as well as an electronic warfare platform. It is fast and agile, allowing it to keep the distance needed to avoid enemy fire while making use of jammers or other electronic gadgets.\n\n\n\nThe markings on this ship reveal no obvious connection to the Republic.',1240,61,2250000,22500,75,1,2,0,'\0',0,0,0,0,16677101,72310,83286),(29882,683,'Independent Breacher','The Breacher\'s structure is little more than a fragile scrapheap, but the ship\'s missile launcher hardpoints and superior sensors have placed it among the most valued Minmatar frigates when it comes to long range combat.\n\n\n\nThe markings on this ship reveal no obvious connection to the Republic.',305,50,1645000,16450,120,1,2,0,'\0',0,0.07,0,0,16677141,72350,83326),(29883,683,'Independent Probe','The Probe is large compared to most Minmatar frigates and is considered a good scout and cargo-runner.  Uncharacteristically for a Minmatar ship, its hard outer coating makes it difficult to destroy, while the limited weapon hardpoints force it to rely on fighter assistance if engaged in combat.\n\n\n\nThe markings on this ship reveal no obvious connection to the Republic.',45,50,1645000,16450,120,1,2,0,'\0',0,0.07,0,0,16677142,72351,83327),(29884,683,'Independent Rifter','The Rifter is a very powerful combat frigate and can easily \n\ntackle the best frigates out there. It has gone through \n\nmany radical design phases since its inauguration during \n\nthe Minmatar Rebellion. The Rifter has a wide variety of \n\noffensive capabilities, making it an unpredictable and deadly adversary. \n\n\n\nThe markings on this ship reveal no obvious connection to the Republic.',46,50,1645000,16450,120,1,2,0,'\0',0,0.07,0,0,16677143,72352,83328),(29885,683,'Independent Slasher','The Slasher is cheap, but versatile. It\'s been manufactured en masse, making it one of the most common vessels in Minmatar space. The Slasher is extremely fast, with decent armaments, and is popular amongst budding pirates and smugglers.\n\n\n\nThe markings on this ship reveal no obvious connection to the Republic.',44,50,1645000,16450,120,1,2,0,'\0',0,0.07,0,0,16677144,72353,83329),(29886,683,'Independent Vigil','The Vigil is an unusual Minmatar ship, serving both as a long range scout as well as an electronic warfare platform. It is fast and agile, allowing it to keep the distance needed to avoid enemy fire while making use of jammers or other electronic gadgets.\n\n\n\nThe markings on this ship reveal no obvious connection to the Republic.',1240,50,1645000,16450,120,1,2,0,'\0',0,0.07,0,0,16677145,72354,83330),(29887,683,'Independent Veteran Breacher','The Breacher\'s structure is little more than a fragile scrapheap, but the ship\'s missile launcher hardpoints and superior sensors have placed it among the most valued Minmatar frigates when it comes to long range combat.\n\n\n\nThe markings on this ship reveal no obvious connection to the Republic.',305,50,1645000,16450,120,1,2,0,'\0',0,0.07,0,0,16677176,7238